{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:10 2026-06-05 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"潘子聰醫生（左二）、李桂嫦（左四）、姜炳輝（左五）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/61c44c0ff34d0c395ee64c79ba49bc5c/2026-06/178063883574551.jpg\"/>\n<p>由「日上」系馬主姜炳輝和其太太李桂嫦、「飛輪霸」馬主廖世偉一起舉辦的JOT 2026哥爾夫球比賽於今天在深圳西麗高爾夫球場正式舉行，多位騎練都踴躍參與，反應熱烈，包括告東尼、蘇偉賢、方嘉柏、黎昭昇、希斯、甘敏斯（下季在港開倉）、潘頓、巴度、班德禮、希威森、霍宏聲及艾道拿等都有參與；馬主則有現任香港馬主協會主席鄧偉業及「俏眼光」馬主潘子聰醫生等。</p>\n<p>姜炳輝及太太李桂嫦，以及廖世偉均很有熱心，落力籌備比賽，他們的好友「閃耀」系馬主鄧鉅明及「飛輪」系馬主沈墨寧都有到場支持；而下午還會舉行Poolside BBQ（池畔燒烤），讓騎練及其另一半盡興一番。</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img alt=\"（左起）希威森、霍宏聲、班德禮及廖世偉\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/711f5497fbdecc405f4424119e050183/2026-06/178063898142069.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6fbf5589bfd34d2f2115fb469fbe2c65/2026-06/2d396edc-698a-48ad-a8d3-a61137f61e57.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/27d02ad2d6f7eab5abf57d83ae230366/2026-06/3bb8dd5d-9521-4193-8186-eb40254719c3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女子組比賽\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ddd39be3bc2c20bbd2c727a79c0e3957/2026-06/178063916126786.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"巴度（左）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c949b0ccf8d4a60440d086551483a6db/2026-06/178063916184411.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方嘉柏（左）與潘頓\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4ef4b8540848886072700c181c57d93c/2026-06/178063916181570.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方嘉柏有姿勢有實際。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b6e17e0509f5fc647b07e276278980e0/2026-06/178063926064486.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"布文（中）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/41927babcfc77dcfa0d0bd11b01d2e1c/2026-06/178063926011472.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"布文（左）與潘頓先禮後兵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/412163480204b324e8d320071b44e56e/2026-06/178063926022723.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"艾道拿\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b7ccd8e1b38df413b4a10430b7e90168/2026-06/178063926054261.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"告東尼（左）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/36346076f011b61b88f26337598b911e/2026-06/178063938454959.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"告東尼\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7c34fc8f8e541186aae04b94bd756061/2026-06/178063938414012.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"希斯\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/add770bcd12bd7dc46bef178c2f91210/2026-06/178063938465340.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"金誠剛\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0123eaf954a45db2b731a2516694a159/2026-06/178063938453968.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"桂福特（左）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/26c894f89ad29a4ed9294410236d2a8b/2026-06/178063954451322.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"開心大合照\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/872c353f8713f15700440c341fcd8206/2026-06/178063954492050.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"潘頓\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/31bb4a4f4d3c735e91145a45038c170e/2026-06/178063954476909.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇偉賢（中）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/359e629a62f2539f04536be3dd7e8e02/2026-06/178063954453725.jpg\"/>\n<p>陳嘉甜</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T08:03:34.401985+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":19,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}